      "writtenOn": "2023-05-02T00:55:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Mengjun, we either \nA. count the entire traffic of the sub, \nor B. only count the traffic generated by the default mobile network.\nFrom my current understanding, A is only motivated by the UI display. B is motivated from API perspective as measurement for internet throughput, which will be used by feature like switch data automatically.\nBecause the UI arrow is a legacy work that we no longer maintain, I suggest that we go with B. What do you think?",
