      "writtenOn": "2023-05-04T02:11:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e handleTrafficStatsPoll is effecting bandwidth estimation.\n\nWith this change I think the intent is for the bandwidth estimator to count internet traffic only, so that it can be used for e.g. auto data switch feature. If ok with change of meaning, I think we can adjust the threshold accordingly.",
